sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DSPO as DSPO Controller Manager<br/>8081/TCP Health
    participant Webhook as DSPO Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Engine<br/>(Provisioned)
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>(mlflow.opendatahub.io)
    participant Prometheus as prometheus-operator

    Note over User,Prometheus: Pipeline Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply DSPA CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate/Mutate DSPA<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: Watch event: DSPA created

    Note over DSPO: DSPAReconciler triggered

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Create owned resources<br/>(ConfigMaps, Secrets, Services,<br/>Deployments, NetworkPolicies,<br/>Routes, Roles, RoleBindings)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: Resources created

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Provision Argo infrastructure<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, ServiceAccounts)<br/>via manifestival
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: Argo infra provisioned

    Note over User,Prometheus: Pipeline Execution Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Pipeline CR<br/>(pipelines.kubeflow.org/v2beta1)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate PipelineVersion<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: Watch event: Pipeline created

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>(argoproj.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Argo: Watch event: Workflow created

    Argo->>K8sAPI: Create/manage Pods<br/>Auth: argo ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Argo: Pod status updates

    Note over DSPO,Prometheus: Monitoring & Integration

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Watch KServe InferenceService
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: InferenceService state

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Watch MLflow CRs
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: MLflow instance state

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>(monitoring.coreos.com)
    K8sAPI-->>Prometheus: ServiceMonitor discovered

    Note over DSPO: Health check endpoints
    K8sAPI->>DSPO: GET /healthz (8081/HTTP)
    DSPO-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>DSPO: GET /readyz (8081/HTTP)
    DSPO-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
